! Transport data for the four retained species.
! Values are the corresponding CHEMKIN transport parameters used with the
! San Diego/UCSD H2 mechanism data family.
!
! Format:
! species  geometry  well-depth[K]  diameter[A]  dipole[Debye]
!          polarizability[A^3]  rotational-relaxation
!
! H2, O2, H2O and N2 values are consistent with the therm.dat supplied by user.

